# Cloudflare uploads everything not listed here as a public static asset,
# so without these the repo's own documentation would be served from the
# site: flield.com/README.md, /CONTRIBUTING.md, and the issue templates were
# all returning 200 and were indexable as thin duplicates of pages that
# already exist. They belong on GitHub; a 404 is the right answer here.
*.md
.github

# Repo config, likewise not part of the site.
.gitignore
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc

.git
.wrangler
